s-c1859850774-26 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Benefits\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-27\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-27\"> Benefits </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-27 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-26 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-26\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ul>\n    <li>Retirees are eligible for a discount on their base fare in Guest class only, for any Saudia flight booked through the website.</li>\n    <li>Only Saudi citizens can benefit from the Retiree discount.</li>\n    <li>Passengers can enjoy a range of services available to them through the Saudia website like seat selection, purchase of baggage and Wi-Fi vouchers, issuance of boarding passes, flight time enquiries and more.</li>\n</ul></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-28 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-29 ng-tns-c1859850774-28 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How it works\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-29\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-29\"> How it works </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-28 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-28\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ul>\n<li>To benefit from the Retiree discount, we must first verify your eligibility. Please enter your national ID number and date of birth.</li>\n<li>To be eligible, the passenger must be registered with the General Organization for Social Insurance. If the passenger is not registered, they should contact the General Organization for Social Insurance for registration. Once the request is approved, the passenger will be eligible and can request a reduction in fares.</li>\n</ul></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-30 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-31 ng-tns-c1859850774-30 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Terms and conditions\t\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-31\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-31\"> Terms and conditions\t </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expans